# Configure a Hybrid Storefront with Hybrid Auth

Copy as Markdown

View as Markdown

Copy URL to Markdown

With B2C Commerce version 25.3, hybrid authentication (Hybrid Auth) replaces the Plugin SLAS cartridge option.

[Hybrid Auth] is a standalone solution for site implementations that need both Storefront Reference Architecture (SFRA)/SiteGenesis (SG) authorization and Shopper Login and API Access Service (SLAS) authorization.

Note

We highly recommend migrating to Hybrid Auth so that you can take advantage of the improved performance and streamlined workflow.

For complete implementation details, see [Hybrid Auth].

Node 20 Deprecation

Node 20 has an end-of-life date of April 30, 2026.

